#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_meli_config__consecutive_refresh_failures
msgid "Number of network-level refresh failures in a row (DNS, timeout, connection refused). Resets to 0 on any successful refresh. Only reaching 3 in a row marks the connection as 'Error' — a single transient network blip no longer permanently disables the integration."
